  "description": "<div style=\"font-family: Poppins;\"><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Acrely Farms</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp;is a women-owned botanical wellness company crafting luxury, farm-to-bottle products that connect people to nature through sustainable self-care. Nestled in Utah’s high mountain valleys, our botanical flower farm grows &nbsp;organic botanicals and artisan hemp, hand-harvested and thoughtfully crafted into small-batch oils, salves, and other essentials.<br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Every product is designed to nourish skin, soothe muscles, and restore balance with clean, effective ingredients straight from our fields.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">By controlling every step from bloom to bottle, we ensure sustainability, transparency, and the highest quality.&nbsp;<br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Discover the difference women-led, organic craftsmanship can make—where every product embodies the beauty of nature and the care behind it. We can't wait to work with you!</span></p></div>",
